{"_id":"APOFdrugSycorax1","name":"Sycorax","type":"item","img":"","system":{"description":"<p>A powerful drug created only from fruits that only grow in The Burrows.</p><ul><li>Grants +20 to Body Saves made when installing cybermods.</li><li>Heals Xd10 DMG where X is equal to the number of slots of cybermods and slickware installed.</li><li>Every time you take Sycorax make a mark on your character sheet and roll a d10. If you roll equal to or lower than the number of Sycorax you have taken gain a random Mutation, then reset back to zero.</li><li>Addictive.</li></ul><p><strong>Street Names:</strong> Psycho, Sigh, Rax, RX, Slickstim, Seed</p>","cost":"750cr","quantity":1,"notes":"Drug, Addictive"},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.6.0","coreVersion":"13","createdTime":1706832000000,"modifiedTime":1706832000000,"lastModifiedBy":"apof-module"}}
